{"unit_id":"frostming__dsh-hongguo#card-zh","repo":"frostming/dsh-hongguo","commit":"a914be7599b99abf713ff7134511910396377f22","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"摸鱼短剧（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在右侧边栏提供短剧浏览与播放，也可把播放器交给独立浏览器页面。它通过 Host 路由获取推荐剧集、搜索结果、分集与播放地址，并在客户端注册标签页、侧栏按钮和 Agent 运行提示。主要功能包括剧集搜索与翻页、选集播放、观看进度续播、播放历史管理，以及倍速、画中画、全屏和自动连播；Agent 从运行转为空闲时会暂停播放。适合希望在等待任务时观看短剧并随时切换会话的用户。使用前需要安装 ffmpeg 以处理加密剧集；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1820-1852","index.js:784-939","standalone/app.js:617-636"]}
{"unit_id":"frostming__dsh-hongguo#card-en","repo":"frostming/dsh-hongguo","commit":"a914be7599b99abf713ff7134511910396377f22","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Drama Break is a DSH Web plugin for short dramas in the sidebar or a standalone page. Search, choose episodes, resume progress, adjust speed, use picture in picture, and autoplay. Playback pauses when an agent becomes idle. Install ffmpeg on the Host for encrypted episodes; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1820-1852","index.js:784-939","standalone/app.js:617-636"]}
